{"page":390,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:36","surah":28,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُم مُّوسَىٰ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا بَيِّنَـٰتٍ قَالُوا۟ مَا هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحْرٌ مُّفْتَرًى وَمَا سَمِعْنَا بِهَـٰذَا فِىٓ ءَابَآئِنَا ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But when Moses came to them with Our clear signs, they said, ‘These are mere conjuring tricks; we never heard this from our forefathers.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَهُم","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُّوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"with Our Signs","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"bayyinātin","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هَـٰذَآ","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سِحْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a magic","transliteration":"siḥ'run","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّفْتَرًۭى","en_gloss":"invented","transliteration":"muf'taran","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَمِعْنَا","en_gloss":"we heard","transliteration":"samiʿ'nā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"of this","transliteration":"bihādhā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ءَابَآئِنَا","en_gloss":"our forefathers","transliteration":"ābāinā","verse_key":"28:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en_gloss":"our forefa